    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b828c992ef496b48b6d53628",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要和她们一起在“菊花赏”朝更高处迈进。\n八重无敌的微笑透露出这样的意图。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f9c8788f1c77d446fd5158f62ea7433d48e8898886ef683eb01e56fe980de7b",
