    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e6c20ce554a815e45ae87ea",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "的确，八重无敌和超级溪流对峙时，\n并没有产生强烈的竞争心。\n我能想到一个原因──",
      "source_fingerprint": "f66dfeee5494ca4ae6afa850433111773e806ed031ca2873a862e1e080315ae3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072314.json",
      "json_path": [
