      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为原本与自己激烈竞争的劲敌没有参赛。\n八重无敌一直以来，\n都怀抱着想要赢过那两人的强烈意志。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b02864caa0b461fa4949eaeb5660958f0223de3dd9bf7f9ee48d3bd10a1c89e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
