      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那成为她对胜利的执着。\n我告诉八重无敌，\n今天并未从她身上感觉到那股执着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab23eaf5eafe88a592cd0a92dbe1679726817e966fa546ce48737195519166d5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
